## Docker image

{{#if (eq language "java")}}
```sh
docker build --secret id=maven-settings,src=$HOME/.m2/settings.xml -t {{project.artifact}} .
```
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq language "node")}}
```sh
docker build --secret id=github-token,env=GITHUB_TOKEN -t {{project.artifact}} .
```
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq language "python")}}
```sh
python scripts/get_wheels.py && docker build -t {{project.artifact}} .
```
{{/if}}

Every instance must share one `keys` volume, and the first start must finish before a second instance starts: it is
the one that creates the keys.
{{/if}}

## Where things are

| | |
|---|---|
{{#if (eq language "java")}}
| `NoteController`, `NoteService` | the endpoints and the business logic: permission, organization, audit record, notice |
| `Setup` | this application's permissions, and the demo organization |
| `NoteAuditActions` | the words the audit screen shows for this application's actions |
| `ApiExceptionHandler` | this application's errors in the SDK's envelope |
{{#if cap.email}}
| `NoteNotifications`, `notification-templates/` | the email's type and templates |
{{/if}}
{{#if cap.events}}
| `NoteStatsHandler` | an event handler |
{{/if}}
| `src/main/resources/db/migration` | this application's tables (Flyway) |
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq language "node")}}
| `src/notes.ts` | the endpoints and the business logic: permission, organization, audit record, notice |
| `src/setup.ts` | this application's permissions, and the demo organization |
| `src/main.ts` | the SDK wired in, migrations first |
{{#if cap.events}}
| `src/events.ts` | an event handler |
{{/if}}
| `migrations/` | this application's tables; `prisma/schema.prisma` maps them |
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq language "python")}}
| `notes.py` | the endpoints and the business logic: permission, organization, audit record, notice |
| `seeding.py` | this application's permissions, and the demo organization |
| `main.py` | the SDK wired in, migrations first |
{{#if cap.events}}
| `events.py` | an event handler |
{{/if}}
| `migrations/` | this application's tables |
{{/if}}
